      "dc:source": "data-availability-and-transparency-consequential-amendments-act-2022.pdf, p.6",
      "values:originalText": "The whole of\nthis Act\nAt the same time as the Data Availability\nand Transparency Act 2022 commences.\nHowever, the provisions do not commence\nat all if that Act does not commence.",
      "skos:definition": "The whole of\nthis Act\nAt the same time as the Data Availability\nand Transparency Act 2022 commences.\nHowever, the provisions do not commence\nat all if that Act does not commence.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
