      "values:originalText": "prescribed administrative action)\nInsert:\n\n; or (f) the exercise of a power under Part 5.2 (accreditation\nframework) of the Data Availability and Transparency Act\n2022.\nFreedom of Information Act 1982",
      "skos:definition": "prescribed administrative action)\nInsert:\n\n; or (f) the exercise of a power under Part 5.2 (accreditation\nframework) of the Data Availability and Transparency Act\n2022.\nFreedom of Information Act 1982",
