      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::argumentation",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(2) The Commissioner may share only information and documents under subsection (1) that were acquired by the Commissioner in the course of exercising powers, or performing functions or duties, under this Act."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:data-availability-and-transparency-consequential-amendments-act-2022-sch-1-sec-36b-ss-2-logic-diffusion-4",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Diffusion"
      },
      "cml:operator": "only",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Restricts the scope of information and documents that can be shared",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::diffusion",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(2) The Commissioner may share only information and documents under subsection (1) that were acquired by the Commissioner in the course of exercising powers, or performing functions or duties, under this Act."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:data-availability-and-transparency-consequential-amendments-act-2022-sch-1-sec-36b-ss-2-logic-cogai-5",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:CogAI"
      },
      "cml:operator": "must",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Expresses a requirement for the Commissioner to share information and documents within certain conditions",
      "cml:executionSurface": "sparql_library::parsers::chk_parser",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(2) The Commissioner may share only information and documents under subsection (1) that were acquired by the Commissioner in the course of exercising powers, or performing functions or duties, under this Act."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:data-availability-and-transparency-consequential-amendments-act-2022-sch-1-sec-36b-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "36B(3) Complaints relating to the data sharing scheme",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/data-availability-and-transparency-consequential-amendments-act-2022#sch-1-sec-36b-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "data-availability-and-transparency-consequential-amendments-act-2022.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "data-availability-and-transparency-consequential-amendments-act-2022.pdf, p.7",
      "values:originalText": "(3) To avoid doubt, the Commissioner may share information or\ndocuments with the NDC under this section whether or not the\nCommissioner is transferring the complaint or part of the\ncomplaint to the NDC.\nNote:\nThe Commissioner may transfer the complaint to the NDC under\nsection 50, if the Commissioner is of the opinion that the complaint\ncould have been made to the NDC.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) To avoid doubt, the Commissioner may share information or\ndocuments with the NDC under this section whether or not the\nCommissioner is transferring the complaint or part of the\ncomplaint to the NDC.\nNote:\nThe Commissioner may transfer the complaint to the NDC under\nsection 50, if the Commissioner is of the opinion that the complaint\ncould have been made to the NDC.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:data-availability-and-transparency-consequential-amendments-act-2022-sch-1-sec-36b"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:data-availability-and-transparency-consequential-amendments-act-2022-sch-1-sec-36b-ss-3-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "baa166d462652ba49d2c94cb4a836997f63c5459b7900301d08de35cb4908f79",
      "skos:note": "Commissioner may share information with NDC under this section."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/data-availability-and-transparency-consequential-amendments-act-2022#sch-1-sec-36b-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "36B(3) Complaints relating to the data sharing scheme",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 7,
      "values:originalText": "(3) To avoid doubt, the Commissioner may share information or\ndocuments with the NDC under this section whether or not the\nCommissioner is transferring the complaint or part of the\ncomplaint to the NDC.\nNote:\nThe Commissioner may transfer the complaint to the NDC under\nsection 50, if the Commissioner is of the opinion that the complaint\ncould have been made to the NDC."
    },
