      "values:originalText": "Insert:\n\n(ia) to the National Data Commissioner under Part 5.3 of the\nData Availability and Transparency Act 2022; or\n\nApplication provisions  Schedule 2\n\nNo. 12, 2022\nData Availability and Transparency (Consequential Amendments) Act",
