    {
      "@id": "concept:data-availability-and-transparency-consequential-amendments-act-2022-sch-2-sec-1",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "1 Applications for accreditation under the Data Availability",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/data-availability-and-transparency-consequential-amendments-act-2022#sch-2-sec-1"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "data-availability-and-transparency-consequential-amendments-act-2022.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "data-availability-and-transparency-consequential-amendments-act-2022.pdf, p.9",
      "values:originalText": "and Transparency Act 2022\n(1)\nAn entity may apply for accreditation as an accredited user or an ADSP\nunder section 76 of the Data Availability and Transparency Act 2022 on\nor after the day after the end of the period of 4 months beginning on the\nday this Act receives the Royal Assent.\n(2)\nHowever, an entity that is a Commonwealth body, a State body or a\nTerritory body may apply for accreditation as an accredited user under\nsection 76 of the Data Availability and Transparency Act 2022 on or\nafter the day after the end of the period of 2 months beginning on the\nday this Act receives the Royal Assent.\n(3)\nApplications for accreditation as an accredited user or an ADSP under\nsection 76 of the Data Availability and Transparency Act 2022 may not\nbe made except in accordance with subitems (1) and (2).\n\nSchedule 3  Transitional provisions\n\nData Availability and Transparency (Consequential Amendments) Act\nNo. 12, 2022",
      "skos:definition": "and Transparency Act 2022\n(1)\nAn entity may apply for accreditation as an accredited user or an ADSP\nunder section 76 of the Data Availability and Transparency Act 2022 on\nor after the day after the end of the period of 4 months beginning on the\nday this Act receives the Royal Assent.\n(2)\nHowever, an entity that is a Commonwealth body, a State body or a\nTerritory body may apply for accreditation as an accredited user under\nsection 76 of the Data Availability and Transparency Act 2022 on or\nafter the day after the end of the period of 2 months beginning on the\nday this Act receives the Royal Assent.\n(3)\nApplications for accreditation as an accredited user or an ADSP under\nsection 76 of the Data Availability and Transparency Act 2022 may not\nbe made except in accordance with subitems (1) and (2).\n\nSchedule 3  Transitional provisions\n\nData Availability and Transparency (Consequential Amendments) Act\nNo. 12, 2022",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:data-availability-and-transparency-consequential-amendments-act-2022-sch-2-sec-1-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:data-availability-and-transparency-consequential-amendments-act-2022-sch-2-sec-1-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "179aa9716c929d55226ba107acf1b0a153b44688e83c6379a74ade1762ac040a",
      "skos:note": "Entities must apply for accreditation within specified timeframes."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/data-availability-and-transparency-consequential-amendments-act-2022#sch-2-sec-1",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "1 Applications for accreditation under the Data Availability",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 9,
      "values:originalText": "and Transparency Act 2022\n(1)\nAn entity may apply for accreditation as an accredited user or an ADSP\nunder section 76 of the Data Availability and Transparency Act 2022 on\nor after the day after the end of the period of 4 months beginning on the\nday this Act receives the Royal Assent.\n(2)\nHowever, an entity that is a Commonwealth body, a State body or a\nTerritory body may apply for accreditation as an accredited user under\nsection 76 of the Data Availability and Transparency Act 2022 on or\nafter the day after the end of the period of 2 months beginning on the\nday this Act receives the Royal Assent.\n(3)\nApplications for accreditation as an accredited user or an ADSP under\nsection 76 of the Data Availability and Transparency Act 2022 may not\nbe made except in accordance with subitems (1) and (2).\n\nSchedule 3  Transitional provisions\n\nData Availability and Transparency (Consequential Amendments) Act\nNo. 12, 2022"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:data-availability-and-transparency-consequential-amendments-act-2022-sch-2-sec-1-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:data-availability-and-transparency-consequential-amendments-act-2022-sch-2-sec-1"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
